<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES SCORE 275 FOR SEVEN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES SCORE 275 FOR SEVEN.</headline>
<dateline>TOOWOOMBA, Australia 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies made 275 for seven from 50 overs in their limited overs tour match against an Australian Country XI on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Score - West Indies 275 for seven in 50 overs (Shivnarine Chanderpaul 123, Sherwin Campbell 65) v Australian Country XI.</p>
